{"c":[{"id":"13a625ab21eb3fe9","sum":"SumMem 0.12.0 lives at .summem/summem (AGENTS.md Project Memory block is the write rule); .scratch/ is gitignored local scratch, never committed.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T170845Z-b7aad83361017857","text":"Onboarded SumMem 0.12.0 as .summem/summem (not a packages/ pin); AGENTS.md Project Memory block is the write rule.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T172705Z-bea3983b0d18183c","text":".scratch/ is gitignored local scratch (exports, dumps); do not commit it","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ab8c7585980a9874","sum":"v1 Caret keeps five upstreams (KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern, Screenpipe); Screenpipe history is a sidecar plus last-N facade, never vendored, no TCC inherited from its CLI.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T173934Z-80f0ac884170d4c1","text":"Caret keeps five upstreams: KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern and Screenpipe. docs/input-pipeline.md defines the proposed shared Jev/context/workflow handoff; the current action UI does not call the Python CLI.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T174647Z-c6a318f44bd68335","text":"Screenpipe history for Caret is sidecar plus facade (last N minutes/windows); do not vendor current engine or inherit TCC from their CLI","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
